{
  "name": "crown_band_rows — strut.fit reports the load-governed segment; strut.fit.crown reports the sized-to-fit crown informationally (AUDIT-FIXES C, H7)",
  "comments": {
    "hand": [
      "PLAN 10 default inputs. Governing pattern for strut.fit is 1.2D+1.6L all-on (largest H).",
      "Load-governed row (strut.fit): the crown segment is sized to DCR = 1.0 by construction, so the actionable",
      "governing segment is the springing arch.0:",
      "  z = 185.612105 (closed form, asserted in default_case); H = 18452.772/185.612105 = 99.415779 k;",
      "  first vertex at x1 = 15.6 in, y1 = 0.2*z = 37.122421 (lumped M ratio at the first UDL centroid is exactly 0.2);",
      "  alpha0 = atan2(37.122421, 15.6) = 67.206334 deg; fce*tw = 1.434375*12 = 17.2125 k/in;",
      "  wReq0 = H/(cos(alpha0)*17.2125) = 99.415779/(0.387457*17.2125) = 14.908585 in;",
      "  wsL = 30*sin(67.206334) + 7*cos(67.206334) = 27.656722 + 2.712201 = 30.369075 in (governs; V1 face = 43.672052);",
      "  fitDcr = 14.908585/30.369075 = 0.490913 — the spec's 14.91/30.37 = 0.491.",
      "Crown row (strut.fit.crown): middle segment arch.5 is horizontal at y = z between the two Mmax vertices;",
      "  wReq = a = H/(fce*tw) = 2*(hp - z) = 2*(188.5 - 185.612105) = 5.775790 in; the top-governed vertex faces echo",
      "  exactly a back (haNode = 2*(hp-z) = a, alpha = 0 -> face = a) -> DCR = 1.0 by construction. Row must be present,",
      "  informational, pass = true, nearLimit = false."
    ]
  },
  "runs": [
    {
      "inputs": {
        "geometry": { "L_w_ft": 28.5, "x_L_ft": 1.25, "x_R_ft": 27.25, "lb_L_in": 30, "lb_R_in": 30, "t_w_in": 12, "h_w_ft": 14, "h_gb_in": 24, "b_gb_in": 24 },
        "loads": { "DL_super_plf": 5525, "LL_plf": 5205 },
        "materials": { "fc_psi": 3000, "fy_ksi": 60 },
        "reinf": { "tieBars": { "count": 4, "size": "#8" }, "topBars": { "count": 4, "size": "#8" }, "cover_bot_in": 3, "cover_side_in": 2, "cover_top_in": 2,
          "web": { "size": "#4", "s_in": 12, "layers": 2 },
          "anchorage": { "left": { "type": "hook" }, "right": { "type": "hook" } } }
      },
      "expect": { "status": "ok", "values": [
        { "path": "checks[id=strut.fit].demand", "value": 14.908584960505213, "rtol": 1e-6, "note": "wReq(arch.0), hand above" },
        { "path": "checks[id=strut.fit].capacity", "value": 30.369075288325547, "rtol": 1e-6, "note": "wsL, hand above" },
        { "path": "checks[id=strut.fit].dcr", "value": 0.4909133656182267, "rtol": 1e-6, "note": "load-governed segment arch.0: 14.908585/30.369075 = 0.490913 (~0.491 per spec)" },
        { "path": "checks[id=strut.fit].label", "value": "Arch band fit (load-governed segment arch.0)" },
        { "path": "checks[id=strut.fit.crown].dcr", "value": 1, "atol": 0.000001, "note": "crown DCR = 1.0 by construction" },
        { "path": "checks[id=strut.fit.crown].demand", "value": 5.775789620467838, "rtol": 1e-6, "note": "wReq(crown) = a = 2*(188.5 - 185.612105) = 5.775790 in" },
        { "path": "checks[id=strut.fit.crown].pass", "value": true },
        { "path": "checks[id=strut.fit.crown].nearLimit", "value": false },
        { "path": "checks[id=strut.fit.crown].informational", "value": true }
      ] }
    }
  ]
}
